{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We all love falling-blocks puzzle games, and we all love the (arguably) two most intricate members of the platonic solids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Namely, the dodecahedron and the icosahedron</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/extras/dotris.gif?t=1743940353\" /> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/extras/icotris.gif?t=1743940353\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psoltrix is the lovechild of Tetris and platonic solids, so these two things never have to be separated again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two game modes, played on a regular dodecahedron and icosahedron, respectively.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different difficulty settings for every skill level. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Variable game speed without a skill ceiling. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many options to individually adjust the visual representation of the playing field. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optional tutorials for an easy introduction to the novel control scheme.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully configurable controls. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playable with keyboard and controller. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2848000?t=1743940353","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743940353","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743940353","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743940353","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We all love falling-blocks puzzle games, and we all love the (arguably) two most intricate members of the platonic solids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Namely, the dodecahedron and the icosahedron</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/extras/dotris.gif?t=1743940353\" /> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/extras/icotris.gif?t=1743940353\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psoltrix is the lovechild of Tetris and platonic solids, so these two things never have to be separated again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two game modes, played on a regular dodecahedron and icosahedron, respectively.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different difficulty settings for every skill level. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Variable game speed without a skill ceiling. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many options to individually adjust the visual representation of the playing field. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optional tutorials for an easy introduction to the novel control scheme.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully configurable controls. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playable with keyboard and controller. </p></li></ul>","developers":["MechanicsDriven"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/header.jpg?t=1743940353","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":